2. It is stated in the petition that on 12052022 about 730 p.m. Prasanth Raja and others were proceeding in a Innova Car bearing No.AP39GY1344 (herein after called as offending vehicle)
from Ramasamudram town via Srinivasapura, at Singanahalli village, Chintamani Taluk,
Chikkaballapura District, its driver drove the same in a rash and negligent manner, lost control and dashed against right portion of Swift car bearing No.KA02MD 1828 and then dashed a tractor from behind.
